globs: **/*.{tsx,jsx,vue,svelte,html,css,scss}
alwaysApply: false
---
Follow DESIGN.md contract at workspace root. Declare one-line [Design Read] before writing markup.
Configure quantitative dials: DESIGN_VARIANCE (1-10), MOTION_INTENSITY (1-10), VISUAL_DENSITY (1-10).
Enforce taste-skill anti-slop directives: commit to one Taste Profile (Minimalist, Industrial-Brutalist, Editorial, Soft-Consumer).
Never emit AI slop: zero em-dashes (—) in copy, no purple/blue gradients, no centered 'AI-powered' pill badges, no repetitive 3-card grids.
OpenHero Above-the-Fold: Bound hero headline to <= 2 lines, subtext < 20 words, select from 6 distinct archetypes (Asymmetric Split, Bento Grid, Command Palette, Interactive Terminal, Dynamic Telemetry, Video/Spatial Canvas).
21st.dev Craft Primitives: Implement tactile spotlight cards with cursor-tracking radial borders, sliding pill indicator tabs, and bounded bento cells.
ThreeUI & SceneAI 3D Governance: WebGL canvases must isolate to background planes with DOM mirrors, throttle/pause offscreen rendering, and provide zero-JS 2D fallbacks.
GSAP Motion: Use hardware-accelerated transforms (x, y, scale), Flip layout morphing, ScrollTrigger scrub sequences, and respect prefers-reduced-motion.
Enforce WCAG 2.2 Level AA accessibility: contrast >= 4.5:1, visible focus rings (:focus-visible), 44x44px touch targets, and contrast scrims over dynamic media.